  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sinograin2: Technological Innovation for Sustainable Food Production</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sinograin II will implement environmental friendly agricultural technologies in China for protecting the environment and human health. It will integrate women needs in all project activities.</narrative>
  </description>
